cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these analyses or their results, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "LOD-AM analyses"
abstract: >-
  Statistical analyses (R) of the released data of LOD-AM (Linked Open Data for
  Ancient Metallurgy). Each run reads one pinned data release and is described
  in PROV-O (records used, release, code, MaRDI methods and software, results),
  so that it becomes part of the LOD-AM knowledge graph.
authors:
